1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,719
That quest is mine.

2
00:00:02,619 --> 00:00:04,944
Nine lines in a text file put it there.

3
00:00:05,844 --> 00:00:09,757
And in the next few minutes, you'll write your own first quest,

4
00:00:10,207 --> 00:00:12,257
and you won't write any code to do it.

5
00:00:14,057 --> 00:00:15,697
This is your fact sheet.

6
00:00:16,597 --> 00:00:18,180
Two hashes make a section,

7
00:00:18,630 --> 00:00:20,881
and this section is Quests,

8
00:00:21,331 --> 00:00:25,281
so everything under it is a quest, until the next section starts.

9
00:00:26,181 --> 00:00:31,071
Right now it holds one story, First Contact, in two steps.

10
00:00:31,971 --> 00:00:33,281
We're going to leave that alone,

11
00:00:33,731 --> 00:00:36,234
and add one of our own underneath it.

12
00:00:38,034 --> 00:00:41,328
I start with three hashes, which makes this a quest of its own.

13
00:00:42,228 --> 00:00:45,415
Then a name the crew will read, and a key.

14
00:00:46,315 --> 00:00:47,572
Then I open the fence.

15
00:00:49,372 --> 00:00:52,774
Shared means it's one quest for the whole crew.

16
00:00:53,674 --> 00:00:57,948
Starts when, at once, means it's live as soon as the game starts.

17
00:00:58,848 --> 00:01:01,557
The objective is the order, in one sentence.

18
00:01:02,457 --> 00:01:05,026
Done when is the one we'll come back to.

19
00:01:05,926 --> 00:01:08,876
Then comes the reward, and I close the fence.

20
00:01:10,676 --> 00:01:12,472
And last, one line of story,

21
00:01:12,922 --> 00:01:14,755
which is the text the crew will read.

22
00:01:16,555 --> 00:01:18,836
This is the line that matters most.

23
00:01:19,736 --> 00:01:24,203
It's a verb, then a role, then a number, in that order.

24
00:01:26,003 --> 00:01:27,665
Reach means get close,

25
00:01:28,115 --> 00:01:31,099
and five hundred is how close.

26
00:01:31,999 --> 00:01:33,913
And derelict is a role,

27
00:01:34,363 --> 00:01:35,399
which you met last time.

28
00:01:36,299 --> 00:01:37,412
Here's the hulk's list:

29
00:01:37,862 --> 00:01:40,676
its side, and then the two roles it wears.

30
00:01:41,576 --> 00:01:44,884
The promise is the same as it was for a reading:

31
00:01:45,334 --> 00:01:47,024
something has to wear the word.

32
00:01:48,824 --> 00:01:50,523
What's new here is the verb.

33
00:01:51,423 --> 00:01:53,503
Last time, a step waited for a signal,

34
00:01:53,953 --> 00:01:56,096
and this file had to say it.

35
00:01:56,996 --> 00:01:58,249
But reach is built in,

36
00:01:58,699 --> 00:02:00,415
so the game does the watching itself.

37
00:02:01,315 --> 00:02:03,752
And that's why there's nothing to change in here.

38
00:02:05,552 --> 00:02:08,118
Here are two slips that lint catches.

39
00:02:09,018 --> 00:02:12,423
The word When, on its own, means when the quest starts,

40
00:02:12,873 --> 00:02:15,095
so nothing ever finishes this quest,

41
00:02:15,545 --> 00:02:17,303
and lint says exactly that.

42
00:02:18,203 --> 00:02:20,975
Then there's a role spelled wrong:

43
00:02:21,425 --> 00:02:23,534
nothing wears it, and lint says that too.

44
00:02:25,334 --> 00:02:27,607
Now here's one it doesn't catch.

45
00:02:28,507 --> 00:02:32,985
If I take out the line that says Starts when, at once,

46
00:02:33,435 --> 00:02:35,460
lint still says clean,

47
00:02:35,910 --> 00:02:37,925
but the quest is only on offer.

48
00:02:39,725 --> 00:02:41,290
The page has a table of these,

49
00:02:41,740 --> 00:02:43,869
and the ones to remember are these:

50
00:02:44,319 --> 00:02:47,477
the number goes last, and nothing goes after it,

51
00:02:47,927 --> 00:02:49,600
and count your hashes.

52
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:54,372
Now I put everything back the way it was, and run lint.

53
00:02:55,272 --> 00:02:58,622
And it's clean, with no errors and no warnings.

54
00:03:00,422 --> 00:03:02,412
Here's the Quest Log, and here's mine,

55
00:03:02,862 --> 00:03:05,524
with its state, its reward, and my description.

56
00:03:06,424 --> 00:03:08,476
So now we fly.

57
00:03:10,276 --> 00:03:12,713
At two thousand, Find the Derelict is done.

58
00:03:13,613 --> 00:03:16,995
But that's last lecture's signal, and not my quest,

59
00:03:17,445 --> 00:03:18,578
so mine hasn't moved.

60
00:03:20,378 --> 00:03:22,097
Then, inside five hundred,

61
00:03:22,547 --> 00:03:24,964
it's done, and the crew is paid.

62
00:03:26,764 --> 00:03:30,284
Now add a second quest, one that finishes on time,

63
00:03:30,734 --> 00:03:33,070
with Done when, two minutes.

64
00:03:33,970 --> 00:03:36,069
That's just a number and a unit.

65
00:03:37,869 --> 00:03:39,818
There are five verbs built in,

66
00:03:40,268 --> 00:03:42,129
and they're all on the page.

67
00:03:43,929 --> 00:03:45,800
Next time we'll join quests together,

68
00:03:46,250 --> 00:03:47,860
so that one leads to the next.
